From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:29:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/41] dt-bindings: spi: apple,spi: Add t8132 compatible

The SPI controllers on t8132 (M4) are compatible with those on t8103.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
index 9356b9c33..abd6a13cf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - items:
-          - const: apple,t6020-spi
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t6020-spi
+              - apple,t8132-spi
           - const: apple,t8103-spi
       - items:
           - enum:
